Join us for our Halloween Market at Donkey and Goat Winery! Enjoy live music, food and wine while shopping from 21 local artists and makers.

This event is also a fundraiser for the Berkeley Humane Society! Vendor fees are being donated to Berkeley Humane to support animal welfare. There will also be opportunities to donate during the event! Berkeley Humane will also have a table at the market where you can learn more about how to foster. 🐈‍⬛❤️

